SUMMARY:This Moment: Highlights from the White Rabbit Collection of Chinese
  Contemporary Art
DESCRIPTION:This exhibition showcases 35 bold and experimental artworks fro
 m 25 Chinese artists\, capturing the spirit of 21st-century China through 
 video\, photography\, painting\, and sculpture. It interrogates authority\
 , reclaims history\, and reflects profound social change.
LOCATION:HOTA Gallery\, Gallery 1\, Surfers Paradise
URL:https://hota.com.au/whats-on/live/exhibitions/the-white-rabbit-collecti
 on-of-chinese-contemporary-art
END:VEVENT
